    "context": "{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:35:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-0-72171\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-0-72171\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:39:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a problem with 'Faulty Authentication Token Expiry Handling'. The API isn't consistently handling expired tokens, which could lead to data handling errors in client applications. This is impacting Customer CUST-0059 and affects the API Layer. @eid_57e922c4, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-1-7945b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-1-7945b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:43:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll look into the token expiry handling issue. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-2-ea521\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-2-ea521\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:44:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Misleading Error Messages for Data Validation Failures'. The API is returning generic error messages, which is confusing for developers. This affects the API Layer and impacts Customer CUST-0007. @eid_b7702c98, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-3-19319\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-3-19319\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:45:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the error messages and make sure they're more descriptive. 🛠️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-4-b6548\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-4-b6548\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:48:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Data Replication Lag' issue causing outdated forecast data to be served due to lag between database nodes. This is affecting the Database Management System and impacting Customer CUST-0005. @eid_b7702c98, can you also take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-5-9569e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-5-9569e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:52:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, I'll tackle the replication lag as well. Let's get these sorted out for our customers! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-6-bea3c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-6-bea3c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:53:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open. If you need any more details or run into issues, just shout. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-7-2c175\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-7-2c175\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T13:56:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll update once I have more info on the token issue. 🕵️‍♂️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-8-e597c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-8-e597c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-27T14:00:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll keep you posted on both the error messages and replication lag. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_bd791efc! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261127-9-75819\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261127-9-75819\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:06:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug about incorrect data being served due to data replication lag has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/41.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-0-57529\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-0-57529\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:08:00\", \"text\": \"That's great news, Bob! Can you explain what was causing the lag?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-1-792ae\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-1-792ae\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:10:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Alice. The root cause was network latency and insufficient bandwidth allocation, which were delaying the synchronization of forecast data between the primary and secondary database nodes.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-2-9e500\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-2-9e500\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:15:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Bob. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-3-fd5f1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-3-fd5f1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:17:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I optimized the network configuration to prioritize replication traffic and increased the bandwidth allocation for the replication process. This ensures that the data syncs more efficiently and reduces the lag significantly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-4-d1b3d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-4-d1b3d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:20:00\", \"text\": \"Nice work, @eid_b7702c98! This should improve the user experience a lot.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-5-e4ee5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-5-e4ee5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:21:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, thanks for handling this so quickly, Bob. Let me know if there's anything else you need from us.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-6-2360f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-6-2360f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-09T14:24:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, David. I'll keep you posted if anything else comes up. For now, everything looks stable.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261209-7-c3d67\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261209-7-c3d67\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T19:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Insecure Password Reset Mechanism'.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-0-9092d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-0-9092d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T19:57:00\", \"text\": \"The concern was that the password reset functionality allows attackers to reset user passwords without proper verification, potentially leading to unauthorized account access.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-1-ca0a2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-1-ca0a2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:00:00\", \"text\": \"After reviewing the authentication module, I found that the current implementation is actually working as intended.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-2-2e136\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-2-2e136\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:01:00\", \"text\": \"The system is designed to use email-based verification, which is considered secure for our current threat model and user base.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-3-5342d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-3-5342d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:04:00\", \"text\": \"The lack of multi-factor authentication or secure token validation was noted, but these are not requirements for our current security policy.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-4-bbc3a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-4-bbc3a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:06:00\", \"text\": \"I verified that the email verification process is functioning correctly and securely, ensuring that only users with access to the registered email can reset their passwords.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-5-0d4ee\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-5-0d4ee\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:10:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_c702b642 Thanks for the update, Alice. So, just to confirm, no changes are needed at this point?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-6-7cd55\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-6-7cd55\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:15:00\", \"text\": \"That's correct, Charlie. No changes are necessary as the system is operating within our defined security parameters.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-7-b5401\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-7-b5401\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:16:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for clarifying, Alice. It's good to know that the email verification is secure enough for now.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-8-a0ae8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-8-a0ae8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:20:00\", \"text\": \"You're welcome, David. If our security requirements evolve, we can revisit this and consider implementing additional verification steps.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-9-47b3e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-9-47b3e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:22:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good. Thanks for the thorough review, Alice!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-10-a7783\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-10-a7783\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-10T20:27:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, happy to help! Let me know if there are any other concerns.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261210-11-71294\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261210-11-71294\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:32:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Data Parsing Algorithm' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/33.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-0-83580\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-0-83580\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:33:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was identified as the algorithm's single-threaded approach, which became a bottleneck when processing large datasets. This led to slow parsing and delayed visualization updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-1-0f243\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-1-0f243\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:37:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I refactored the algorithm to utilize a multi-threaded approach. This allows it to handle large volumes of data more efficiently by distributing the workload across multiple threads.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-2-c295a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-2-c295a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:38:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_8333ab24! This should significantly improve the performance for our users dealing with large datasets.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-3-9bef5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-3-9bef5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Julia! This was a critical fix. I'll run some tests on our end to ensure everything is working smoothly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-4-f03af\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-4-f03af\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:47:00\", \"text\": \"Nice job, Julia. Let me know if you need any help with the deployment process.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-5-7ed29\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-5-7ed29\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T07:48:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_cc27a0cd, @eid_6d9f2150, and David! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing or deployment.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261002-6-cf771\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261002-6-cf771\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:26:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Delayed Response Time Leading to Timeout Errors' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/34.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-0-af64b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-0-af64b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:31:00\", \"text\": \"Great news, @eid_6d9f2150! Could you explain what was causing the issue?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-1-aef9b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-1-aef9b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:35:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, Julia. The root cause was an inefficient query execution plan in the database layer. It was creating bottlenecks during peak usage times, which led to delayed API responses and eventually timeout errors.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-2-12dbd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-2-12dbd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:36:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Hannah. How did you manage to fix it?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-3-da7c5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-3-da7c5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:39:00\", \"text\": \"To resolve the issue, I optimized the query execution plan by adding appropriate indexes and restructuring some of the queries to be more efficient. This significantly reduced the processing time and eliminated the bottlenecks.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-4-5aa32\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-4-5aa32\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:40:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome work, Hannah! This should improve our API performance a lot during peak times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-5-28b62\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-5-28b62\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:42:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Charlie! Let me know if you notice any further issues or if there's anything else I can help with.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-6-84591\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-6-84591\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the quick turnaround, Hannah. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics and let you know if anything comes up.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-7-de605\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-7-de605\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-05T01:45:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone. Let's monitor the system closely over the next few days to ensure everything is stable.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261004-8-1bc0b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261004-8-1bc0b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:00:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-0-7b78c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-0-7b78c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:01:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a 'Memory Leak in Visualization Engine'. The visualization engine is consuming too much memory when rendering large datasets, causing slow performance and crashes. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Engine, impacting customer CUST-0120. @eid_57e922c4, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-1-7477b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-1-7477b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:05:00\", \"text\": \"Got it! I'll start looking into the memory leak issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-2-cee77\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-2-cee77\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:07:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy'. The current strategy isn't efficiently storing and retrieving large datasets, leading to slow visualization updates. This also affects the User Interface & Visualization Engine, impacting customer CUST-0071. @eid_57e922c4, you're on this one too.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-3-97b30\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-3-97b30\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:12:00\", \"text\": \"Understood, I'll tackle the data caching issue as well. If anyone has insights or suggestions, feel free to share! 💡\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-4-ddff3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-4-ddff3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:13:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_57e922c4! Lastly, we have a 'Categorical Encoding Discrepancy'. Incorrect encoding of categorical variables is leading to misinterpretations by the forecasting model. This affects the Data Preprocessing Module and impacts customer CUST-0043. @eid_6d9f2150, can you handle this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-5-c6881\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-5-c6881\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:17:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll dive into the encoding issue and ensure we get accurate predictions. If anyone has encountered similar issues before, let's chat! 🤔\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-6-f0988\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-6-f0988\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:21:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks everyone for jumping on these so quickly! Let's keep the communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or resources. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-7-1cea6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-7-1cea6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:24:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Let's get these sorted for our customers. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-8-83e2c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-8-83e2c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-26T08:26:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, team! Looking forward to resolving these issues. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261026-9-514f8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261026-9-514f8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T17:58:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Weak Encryption of Stored Passwords' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/30.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-0-937aa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-0-937aa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T17:59:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was that our authentication module was using outdated cryptographic algorithms like MD5 and SHA-1 for password storage, which are not secure enough.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-1-0e754\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-1-0e754\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:00:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Bob! What changes did you make to fix this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-2-812b2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-2-812b2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:02:00\", \"text\": \"Good question, Alice. I updated the authentication module to use bcrypt for hashing passwords. Bcrypt is more secure as it incorporates a salt and is computationally intensive, making it much harder to crack.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-3-ec609\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-3-ec609\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:03:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, @eid_b7702c98! Does this change affect any other parts of the system?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-4-574b1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-4-574b1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:06:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, David. The change is isolated to the password storage mechanism, so it shouldn't affect other parts of the system. However, I recommend everyone to test their modules just to be sure.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-5-4224c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-5-4224c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:09:00\", \"text\": \"Will do, Bob. Thanks for the heads-up!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-6-5255a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-6-5255a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:10:00\", \"text\": \"I'll run some tests on my end too. Thanks for the quick resolution!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-7-106d2\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-7-106d2\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-29T18:14:00\", \"text\": \"No problem, happy to help! Let me know if you encounter any issues.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260829-8-2e1b3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260829-8-2e1b3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T15:19:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_bd791efc created this channel on 2026-08-24 15:19:00. This is the very beginning of the bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce channel.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-0-6771d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-0-6771d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T15:19:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_bd791efc joined bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce. Also, @eid_6d9f2150, @eid_9685a278, @eid_c702b642, @eid_57e922c4, @eid_cc27a0cd, @eid_8333ab24, @eid_b7702c98 joined via invite.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-1-4460b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-1-4460b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:20:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-0-19ec3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-0-19ec3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:23:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have a security concern: **Weak Encryption of Stored Passwords**. Passwords are stored using weak encryption algorithms, which could lead to unauthorized access. This affects the Authentication Module and impacts customer CUST-0072. @eid_b7702c98, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-1-def94\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-1-def94\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:27:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll prioritize this issue. Ensuring our encryption is robust is crucial. I'll start by reviewing the current algorithms and propose stronger alternatives. 🔐\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-2-2fbb5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-2-2fbb5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:28:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_b7702c98! Next, we have an issue with **Inaccurate Forecasts Due to Data Preprocessing Error**. The AI model is generating inaccurate forecasts due to errors in data preprocessing, affecting the Data Preprocessing Module. This is impacting customer CUST-0006. @eid_57e922c4, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-3-4e012\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-3-4e012\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:33:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll dive into the data preprocessing logic and identify where the errors are occurring. Ensuring accurate forecasts is key for our users' decision-making. 📊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-4-81422\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-4-81422\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:36:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks @eid_57e922c4! Lastly, we have an **Inefficient Query Execution Plan** issue. The database query optimizer is selecting suboptimal execution plans, causing delays. This affects the Database Management System and impacts customer CUST-0056. @eid_b7702c98, can you also take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-5-28a04\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-5-28a04\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:38:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll analyze the query execution plans and optimize them for better performance. We need to ensure our system is responsive and reliable. 🏃‍♂️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-6-182d3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-6-182d3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:43:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and informed. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or resources. Let's get these issues resolved! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-7-405da\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-7-405da\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:46:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Thanks for the heads-up, @eid_bd791efc. Let's make it happen, team! 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-8-82172\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-8-82172\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-08-24T23:50:00\", \"text\": \"On it! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_bd791efc. Let's keep the momentum going! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260824-9-9f9e8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260824-9-9f9e8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_efb73819\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T11:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, please check my PR for the security and compliance audit: https://github.com/salesforce/castAIX/pull/22. This includes a comprehensive audit to identify compliance gaps with GDPR and HIPAA, recommendations for addressing these gaps, logging of issues for future sprints, and updated documentation. Let me know your thoughts! 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260724-0-1fede\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260724-0-1fede\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T11:58:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for sharing, @eid_efb73819! I'll start reviewing it now. 🕵️‍♀️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260724-1-e6b5a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260724-1-e6b5a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T11:59:00\", \"text\": \"Great, I'll take a look too. Thanks for the detailed summary, @eid_efb73819! 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260724-2-685a8\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260724-2-685a8\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T12:01:00\", \"text\": \"Hey @eid_efb73819, I went through the audit report. It looks thorough and well-documented. The compliance gaps are clearly identified, and the recommendations are actionable. Nice work! 👏\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260724-3-517de\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260724-3-517de\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T12:02:00\", \"text\": \"I agree with Alice Miller. The issues are logged clearly for future sprints, and the documentation updates are spot on. Everything aligns with our acceptance criteria. Well done! 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260724-4-f5907\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260724-4-f5907\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T12:06:00\", \"text\": \"LGTM, approved! 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260724-5-db78c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260724-5-db78c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T12:11:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, LGTM! Approved! ✅\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260724-6-4bcb5\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260724-6-4bcb5\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_efb73819\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T12:12:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_57e922c4 and Alice Jones! Appreciate the quick review and feedback. Let's keep our systems secure and compliant! 🔒\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260724-7-2be0d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260724-7-2be0d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"develop-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-188f59\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-22T15:25:00\", \"text\": \"@here try out our product with this live demo https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/ForecastForce/demo_10\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260722-0-3281e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260722-0-3281e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T18:56:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that need our immediate attention. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-0-1ea5d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-0-1ea5d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:00:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an 'Insecure Password Reset Mechanism' issue. The password reset functionality is allowing attackers to reset user passwords without proper verification. This affects the Authentication Module and puts user accounts at risk of unauthorized access. Impacted customer: CUST-0013. @eid_c702b642, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-1-f73c3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-1-f73c3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:04:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, I'll start looking into the password reset mechanism right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-2-0a403\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-2-0a403\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:07:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Session Fixation Vulnerability' in the same Authentication Module. This allows attackers to hijack user sessions, again risking unauthorized access to sensitive data. Impacted customer: CUST-0007. @eid_c702b642, you're on this one too.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-3-9dc51\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-3-9dc51\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:08:00\", \"text\": \"Understood, I'll tackle the session fixation issue as well. I'll make sure to prioritize these vulnerabilities. 🛡️\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-4-aba5e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-4-aba5e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:10:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks for jumping on these so quickly! Lastly, we have a 'UI Freezes During High-Volume Data Visualization' issue. The UI becomes unresponsive with large datasets, affecting the User Interface & Visualization Engine. This is impacting customer CUST-0083. @eid_cc27a0cd, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-5-96a79\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-5-96a79\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:11:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll dive into the UI and visualization engine to see what's causing the freeze. Let's get this sorted out for CUST-0083. 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-6-e5661\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-6-e5661\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:12:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, everyone! Let's keep the communication open and update each other on progress. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional info. 🙌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-7-80bba\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-7-80bba\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_c702b642\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:13:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! I'll keep you posted on the authentication issues. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-8-3d6fd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-8-3d6fd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-12-05T19:18:00\", \"text\": \"Same here, I'll update once I have more info on the UI issue. Thanks for coordinating, @eid_bd791efc!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261205-9-fa36c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261205-9-fa36c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T13:41:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with ForecastForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-0-13ba9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-0-13ba9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T13:43:00\", \"text\": \"First up, we have an issue titled 'Inefficient Data Parsing Algorithm'. The data parsing algorithm is struggling with large datasets, causing prolonged loading times and delayed visualization updates. This affects the User Interface & Visualization Engine, impacting customer CUST-0117. @eid_8333ab24, this one's for you.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-1-90e7e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-1-90e7e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T13:47:00\", \"text\": \"Got it, thanks! I'll dive into the data parsing algorithm and see how we can optimize it for better performance. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-2-7d0ff\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-2-7d0ff\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T13:49:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks! Next, we have 'Delayed Response Time Leading to Timeout Errors'. The API is experiencing delays under certain conditions, leading to timeout errors that aren't properly communicated to clients. This affects the API Layer and impacts customer CUST-0048. @eid_6d9f2150, can you take this one?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-3-ab2b9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-3-ab2b9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T13:52:00\", \"text\": \"Sure thing! I'll look into the API response times and ensure proper error handling is in place. 👍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-4-cadaa\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-4-cadaa\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T13:53:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_6d9f2150! Lastly, we have 'Excessive Lock Contention'. There's high lock contention when multiple transactions access the same forecast data, causing delays. This affects the Database Management System and impacts customer CUST-0072. @eid_cc27a0cd, can you handle this?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-5-f2135\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-5-f2135\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T13:58:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, I'll investigate the lock contention issue and work on reducing wait times. 🔍\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-6-c3f9a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-6-c3f9a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T14:00:00\", \"text\": \"Awesome, thanks everyone! If you need any more details or run into issues, feel free to reach out. Let's get these resolved for our customers! 💪\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-7-abe16\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-7-abe16\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_8333ab24\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T14:03:00\", \"text\": \"Will do! Thanks for the heads-up. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-8-2ed74\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-8-2ed74\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T14:07:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, I'll keep you posted on the progress. 👌\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-9-85a51\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-9-85a51\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_cc27a0cd\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-24T14:09:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, team! Let's make it happen. 🚀\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260924-10-3b26c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260924-10-3b26c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T06:53:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Categorical Encoding Discrepancy'.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-0-160ec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-0-160ec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T06:58:00\", \"text\": \"The concern was that incorrect encoding of categorical variables was leading to misinterpretation by the forecasting model.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-1-86aa7\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-1-86aa7\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:01:00\", \"text\": \"After reviewing the process, I've determined that this is not a bug and does not require a fix.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-2-bcad6\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-2-bcad6\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:04:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for the update, Hannah. Could you explain why it's not considered a bug?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-3-49e26\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-3-49e26\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:06:00\", \"text\": \"Sure, @eid_57e922c4. The encoding process is actually working as intended. The discrepancy arises from a misconfiguration in the dataset preparation step.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-4-29949\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-4-29949\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:09:00\", \"text\": \"The categories were not aligned across different datasets due to inconsistent data inputs, which led to the perceived issue.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-5-996a3\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-5-996a3\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:12:00\", \"text\": \"So, it's more of a data preparation issue rather than a problem with the encoding itself?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-6-3611a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-6-3611a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:15:00\", \"text\": \"Exactly, David. The encoding logic is sound, but the input data needs to be standardized before processing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-7-439df\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-7-439df\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:20:00\", \"text\": \"I verified this by running tests with properly aligned datasets, and the model interpreted the categorical data correctly.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-8-e9500\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-8-e9500\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:21:00\", \"text\": \"Got it. Thanks for clarifying, Hannah. We'll make sure to check the data alignment in future dataset preparations.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-9-5f7d4\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-9-5f7d4\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:23:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Hannah. I'll update the documentation to highlight the importance of consistent data inputs.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-10-75c78\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-10-75c78\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-07T07:26:00\", \"text\": \"Great, thanks everyone! Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261106-11-a62c0\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261106-11-a62c0\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-21T03:10:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Suboptimal Data Caching Strategy' has been resolved. 🎉\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261120-0-ba400\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261120-0-ba400\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-21T03:11:00\", \"text\": \"The issue was that our current caching mechanism wasn't prioritizing frequently accessed data, which led to repeated data fetching and slow visualization updates.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261120-1-63d77\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261120-1-63d77\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-21T03:12:00\", \"text\": \"I've implemented a fix by introducing a Least Recently Used (LRU) caching strategy. This ensures that the most frequently accessed data is prioritized, reducing unnecessary data retrieval operations and improving latency.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261120-2-a4027\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261120-2-a4027\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-21T03:13:00\", \"text\": \"You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/38\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261120-3-3977c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261120-3-3977c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_6d9f2150\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-21T03:15:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, Alice! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll test it out and see how it performs with the large datasets.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261120-4-be03d\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261120-4-be03d\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-21T03:17:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_57e922c4! The LRU caching strategy sounds like a solid improvement. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261120-5-0d164\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261120-5-0d164\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-21T03:21:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Hannah and David! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help. 😊\", \"utterranceID\": \"20261120-6-d9899\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20261120-6-d9899\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T21:19:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/ForecastForce/pull/32.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-0-5857e\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-0-5857e\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T21:23:00\", \"text\": \"The root cause was that the query optimizer was selecting suboptimal execution plans due to outdated statistics and missing indexes. This led to prolonged execution times for complex forecast data retrieval queries.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-1-8ce94\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-1-8ce94\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T21:25:00\", \"text\": \"To fix this, I updated the database statistics and added the necessary indexes to ensure the query optimizer can accurately estimate the cost of different execution paths. This should significantly improve the execution times.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-2-01c86\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-2-01c86\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_57e922c4\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T21:27:00\", \"text\": \"Great work, Bob! Thanks for resolving this so quickly. I'll test it out and let you know if I encounter any issues.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-3-d725b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-3-d725b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T21:29:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, @eid_b7702c98! This should help a lot with the performance issues we've been seeing. I'll also run some tests on my end.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-4-07d37\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-4-07d37\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"bug-davidgarcia-ForecastForce\", \"channelID\": \"ch-force-d1c875\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b7702c98\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-04T21:34:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Alice and David. Let me know if you notice any other issues. I'm here to help!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260904-5-c6b46\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260904-5-c6b46\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_69067a7c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:18:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about castAIX. It's great to see such positive feedback!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-0-77302\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-0-77302\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"'eid_3b36c220'\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:18:34\", \"text\": \"@here Stay updated with this article on the latest trends in AI-driven forecasting technologies. It highlights key advancements and future directions. https://www.forbes.com/sites/ai-forecasting-trends-2023\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260401-57-bdf07\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260401-57-bdf07\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f9e25d18\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:19:00\", \"text\": \"That's awesome! What did they say, Hannah?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-1-5ba64\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-1-5ba64\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_69067a7c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:22:00\", \"text\": \"Customer CUST-0005 mentioned that the integration with Tableau allows for seamless visualization of forecast data, which improves data interpretation.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-2-fdedd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-2-fdedd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f1bf7140\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:24:00\", \"text\": \"That's a big win! Visualization is key for our users. Who else gave feedback?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-3-eccec\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-3-eccec\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_69067a7c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:25:00\", \"text\": \"Customer CUST-0048 reported that the system handles moderate-sized datasets efficiently while maintaining good performance levels.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-4-a2504\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-4-a2504\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_b5009faa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:26:00\", \"text\": \"It's great to hear that the system is performing well with datasets. Kudos to the previous team for their work!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-5-97a26\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-5-97a26\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_104b8b57\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:31:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_69067a7c, do we have any specific areas we should focus on improving based on other feedback?\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-6-baf8b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-6-baf8b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_69067a7c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:35:00\", \"text\": \"Not yet, Hannah. But I'll compile more feedback and share it soon. Let's keep building on these strengths!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-7-e53f9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-7-e53f9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7871ba4e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:36:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds like a plan. Thanks for sharing, Hannah!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-8-6cdae\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-8-6cdae\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f9e25d18\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T12:41:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Let's keep the momentum going. Great job, team!\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260512-9-c561b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260512-9-c561b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-01T14:07:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_89afe48f joined planning-castAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260401-66-c6f08\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260401-66-c6f08\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f86a00ce\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T22:57:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for castAIX is the lack of customization options for forecast models. This was highlighted by Customer ID: CUST-0065.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-0-23fdb\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-0-23fdb\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86044ae5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T22:59:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, Fiona. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their design choices.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-1-0ec7a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-1-0ec7a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_69067a7c\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T23:02:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed, George. It sounds like the model architecture might be too rigid, not allowing for user modifications.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-2-ff78a\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-2-ff78a\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T23:07:00\", \"text\": \"That's a good point, Hannah. We should also consider if there's limited support for custom model parameters and configurations.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-3-63c10\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-3-63c10\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_7871ba4e\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T23:09:00\", \"text\": \"Right, David. It could be that the focus was on creating generic solutions rather than tailored, business-specific models.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-4-47f9c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-4-47f9c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_89afe48f\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T23:11:00\", \"text\": \"Emma here. Maybe the previous team didn't anticipate the need for more adaptable models. We should definitely look into this.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-5-ab590\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-5-ab590\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f86a00ce\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T23:13:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_89afe48f, I agree. We need to ensure our next release addresses these customization needs.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-6-ef53b\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-6-ef53b\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86044ae5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-02T23:15:00\", \"text\": \"Let's make sure these customer issues are documented in our planning documents for the next release of castAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260419-7-7dd56\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260419-7-7dd56\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"slack_admin_bot\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T00:30:00\", \"text\": \"@eid_d508e9fb joined planning-castAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260403-75-e1180\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260403-75-e1180\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:07:00\", \"text\": \"Hi team, one of the common issues reported for castAIX is occasional inaccuracies in predictions when dealing with highly volatile data. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0099.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-0-281d1\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-0-281d1\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d508e9fb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:08:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the forecasting algorithms used.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-1-7173f\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-1-7173f\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_12f75faa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:12:00\", \"text\": \"Good point, Bob. It could be that the algorithms aren't handling data volatility well enough. We should check if they have any mechanisms for that.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-2-dace9\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-2-dace9\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f86a00ce\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:17:00\", \"text\": \"Agreed. Another angle could be the lack of advanced machine learning models that can adapt to rapid changes in data. We might need to consider integrating more adaptive models.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-3-f0205\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-3-f0205\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_86044ae5\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:21:00\", \"text\": \"That's a valid point, Fiona. Also, we should look into the data preprocessing steps. Insufficient data quality checks might be contributing to these inaccuracies.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-4-3f16c\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-4-3f16c\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_bd791efc\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:22:00\", \"text\": \"Great insights, everyone. Let's make sure we document these potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of castAIX.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-5-e8e19\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-5-e8e19\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_d508e9fb\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:24:00\", \"text\": \"Absolutely, David. I'll start drafting a section in the planning doc to capture these issues and our proposed solutions.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-6-42b23\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-6-42b23\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_12f75faa\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:27:00\", \"text\": \"Thanks, Bob. Let's also schedule a meeting to discuss this further and align on next steps.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-7-8f3bd\"}, \"Reactions\": []}, \"ThreadReplies\": [], \"id\": \"20260404-7-8f3bd\"}\n{\"Channel\": {\"name\": \"planning-castAIX\", \"channelID\": \"ch-staix-62a6a5\"}, \"Message\": {\"User\": {\"userId\": \"eid_f86a00ce\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-04-03T12:28:00\", \"text\": \"Sounds good. I'll coordinate with everyone to find a suitable time.\", \"utterranceID\": \"20260404-8-6b0