        "PR #23 is located at https://github.com/salesforce/CoFoAIX/pull/23.",
        "PR #23 received CHANGES_REQUESTED status.",
        "The tracking feature in PR #23 is not fully functional.",
        "PR #23 received a comment requesting more detailed categorization.",
        "PR #23 was not approved.",
        "PR #23 is actually about support and feedback, not disaster recovery.",
        "PR #20 is titled \"Establishing RTO and RPO\".",
        "PR #20 is located at https://github.com/salesforce/CoFoAIX/pull/20.",
        "Reviewers of PR #20 requested more detail on drill schedules and evaluation criteria.",
        "Reviewers of PR #20 requested information about stakeholder training.",
        "Changes were requested for PR #20.",
        "No approval was given for PR #20 in the thread.",
        "The author of PR #20 said the author would update and re-request review.",
        "PR #8 covers data backups.",
